      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BORN TO ENTERTAIN (3) had a tough draw when last seen in a Nutrien heat and had some strong form prior including a Forbes win two back. Has not raced for four months but looks forward enough after a minor placing in a trial and should have no excuses from the low draw. TRI TIME (5) made a strong start to his career when he led and went on to score by 6 metres at this circuit and distance six weeks ago. Kept fresh and draws wider but he looks talented and has upside. IM EL ARQUERO (8) headed north for a win in the QBred Triad Final at Albion Park before leading from this barrier and sticking on for third behind a couple of smart ones last time. He can push forward again and give a big sight. WICKED MOTION (9) placed in both a heat and the final of the APG series at Menangle at his maiden campaign. May have developed with maturity and has been readied for his return with two nice trials.",
